{"id": "690972", "revid": "539651", "url": "https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=690972", "title": "Hexisea", "text": "Hexisea là một chi lan (family Orchidaceae). The genera Costaricaea and Euothonaea are synonyms of \"Hexisea\". This genus is abbreviated Hxsa in trade journals.\nSynonymy.\nAt the urging of Dressler, \"Hexisea\" has been reduced to synonoymy under \"Scaphyglottis\", over which \"Hexisea\" has priority. The \"Hexisea\" page is conserved here because Dressler's proposal stated, in part: \"...those who so wish may retain \"Hexisea\" in any circumscription that excludes \"S.  graminifolia\" (the type of \"Scaphyglottis;\" see Dressler in Taxon 9:214. 1960)...\""}
